            "reviewBody": "THESE WERE AMAZING! I switched it up by using all butter, and also in place of a cup of shredded coconut (my kids aren't huge fans of coconut) I used 1/2 cup of coconut and 1/2 cup of semi-sweet chocolate chips. left them a little bit underdone in the center and OMG- insanely yummy.",
