            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Pink J"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yummy. It's not a fancy cookie but if you like coconut +/- butterscotch chips, give this recipe a shot. I don't like sweet cookies so I decreased white sugar by half (used 1/4 C) and bakes some cookies without butterscotch chips. Also, I replaced 1/4C + 1/8C of white flour with whole wheat flour. Cookie turned out well but next time, I'll try 10minutes instead of 12 minute to make it chewier. Overall, simple recipe which yielded simple coconut/butterscotch cookies.",
            "datePublished": "2013-01-13T21:54:41.850Z"
          },
          {
