            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Betty Dickson"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Perfect cookie recipe. I was out of butter flavor shortening so I just used butter. I also halved the almond extract because from experience I know I prefer less. I replaced it with butter flavor extract I got when it was 50% off. I doubled the recipe and it was a good thing I did because my other half kept going back for one more.",
            "datePublished": "2020-10-31T05:09:20.947Z"
